        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After attempting several times to find a fix for this, I don't think I can (at least without major rewrite of the whole 'mini.operators' logic).\r\n\r\nAs regular operator usage doesn't affect those marks and plugin has very small control over what is being undone after `u`, I'd consider current behavior \"good enough\".\r\n\r\nClosing as won't (can't) fix.",
